Z||000007||Cooter||09-21-1999||10:46 PM||||I did the carfax history search on my car to try and verify the mileage. It was a waste of money and I e-mailed the company and got a refund on my credit card. They charged $14 and the "history" only went back 2 years. All it showed was the car cleared emission inspection and was sold shortly after that. But it document that the car did not have a previous salvage title, and that is always good to know.||||reg||1
